---
import DocsLayout from '../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout
	title="CLI reference"
	eyebrow="[ 08 · CLI ]"
	description="Headless and interactive entry points — same audit engine."
>
	<h2>Binaries</h2>
	<table>
		<thead>
			<tr>
				<th>Command</th>
				<th>Entry</th>
				<th>Purpose</th>
			</tr>
		</thead>
		<tbody>
			<tr>
				<td><code>kuyfi</code></td>
				<td><code>dist/cli.js</code></td>
				<td>TUI or headless audit</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td><code>kuyfi-server</code></td>
				<td><code>dist/server.js</code></td>
				<td>Paid OSINT HTTP API</td>
			</tr>
		</tbody>
	</table>

	<h2>Modes</h2>
	<p>
		<code>cli.tsx</code> uses <code>meow</code> + <code>selectCliMode()</code>:
		<code>tui</code> | <code>headless</code> | <code>invalid</code>.
	</p>

	<pre><code># Interactive TUI (no args)
kuyfi

# Headless audit
kuyfi &lt;CONTRACT_ID&gt;
kuyfi &lt;CONTRACT_ID&gt; --json
kuyfi &lt;CONTRACT_ID&gt; --pdf
kuyfi &lt;CONTRACT_ID&gt; --json --pdf

# From source checkout
npm start
node dist/cli.js &lt;CONTRACT_ID&gt; --json</code></pre>

	<h2>Contract ID shape</h2>
	<pre><code>/^C[A-Z0-9]&#123;55&#125;$/</code></pre>

	<h2>Exit / errors</h2>
	<p>
		Headless path lives in <code>cli_runtime.ts</code>
		(<code>runHeadlessAudit()</code>). Scan failures surface structured
		<code>ScanError</code> codes; presentation formatting is CLI-specific but classification
		is shared.
	</p>

	<h2>Network</h2>
	<p>
		RPC URL is a single constant in <code>network.ts</code>:
		<code>https://soroban-testnet.stellar.org</code>. No mainnet selector in v0.1.0.
	</p>
</DocsLayout>
